# The lemmas of the HM baseline with unification as unions of classes, in
# the order they were written in one file: hindley_milner_unions_judgments
# (which says what the baseline is), the application rule
# hindley_milner_unions_application, and hindley_milner_unions_occurrences.
# A type check that types applications otherwise lists
# hindley_milner_unions_core and its own rule instead of this module.
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λmixin. mixin mixin)
λ omega
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "hindley_milner_unions_judgments")
λ hindley_milner_unions_judgments
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "hindley_milner_unions_application")
λ hindley_milner_unions_application
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "hindley_milner_unions_occurrences")
λ hindley_milner_unions_occurrences
. export (hindley_milner_unions_judgments + hindley_milner_unions_application + hindley_milner_unions_occurrences)
